    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_01",
      "hash64": "BCFAFC19AC13B591",
      "text": "把材料像這樣用……\\n再把調味料……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_01_02",
      "hash64": "BCFAF919AC13B078",
      "text": "……啊，抱歉！\\n我剛剛在想事情！\\c\\n我正在研究三明治的食譜。\\c\\n我的夢想就是總有一天要發明出\\n被譽為大師等級的極致食譜！\\c\\n可以的話，\\n讓我也跟[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳分享三明治的食譜吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
