    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_02",
      "hash64": "B9BEE907FFCF4C66",
      "text": "那些調味料叫秘傳什麼的，\\n總共有５種……\\c\\n要是我能至少看到那些調味料一眼，\\n或許就能靈光一閃想出新食譜了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
