    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_04",
      "hash64": "B9BEEB07FFCF4FCC",
      "text": "呼、呼……\\n我發明出驚人的食譜了！\\r\\n這正是極致的三明治……！\\r\\n請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳一定要做做看……！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 38,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "sub_047_picnicnpc_03_05",
      "hash64": "B9BEEC07FFCF517F",
      "text": "託[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的福，\\n大師等級的三明治都成形化為現實了！\\c\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳在背後支持我的夢想，\\n真的太感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳了！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
